  "decision_conditions": [
    "The\r\nproposed variation of Condition 4 would weaken a restriction that was imposed\r\nto ensure that the approved annexe remains ancillary to the main dwelling and\r\ndoes not form an independent residential unit. The applicant has failed to\r\ndemonstrate that the proposed replacement wording is necessary or would provide\r\nan effective, precise and enforceable mechanism to prevent independent\r\noccupation of the detached building. As such, the proposal would undermine the\r\nbasis upon which planning permission ref. 25/P1830 was granted and is contrary\r\nto Policies D3, D4 and D6 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies D12.1, D12.2\r\nand D12.3 of the Merton Local Plan (2024)."
  ],
